ost to unfind it. Sonny Moretti pays the family for exactly this kind of trouble. A $280 envelope to the right man would end it, or a conversation might.","extra":{"gig":"inspector","amt":280},"id":"j326","created":1980,"expires":9180,"status":"expired","notes":["It was sorted without you."]},{"kind":"boost","title":"Lenny Bianchi needs cars","brief":"Lenny Bianchi at Bianchi's Auto Repair (The Bronx) is short of stock and asks no questions. He'll pay $650 a car, cash, no paperwork.","giver":"c138","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","biz":"b139","pay":650,"id":"j357","created":3420,"expires":12060,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"boost","title":"Georgie DeLuca needs cars","brief":"Georgie DeLuca at DeLuca's Auto Repair (Little Italy) is short of stock and asks no questions. He'll pay $650 a car, cash, no paperwork.","giver":"c160","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","biz":"b161","pay":650,"id":"j392","created":6300,"expires":14940,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"scam","title":"Tommy Caruso has been flush","brief":"Bobby Esposito says Tommy Caruso (Caruso's Lounge) has had a good run and keeps cash on hand. A smooth talker could part him from some of it.","giver":"c200","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","target":"c106","biz":"b107","pay":0,"id":"j413","created":7740,"expires":16380,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"A truck of meat and wine is due at Bellini's Ristorante","giver":"c178","via":"tip","assignee":"c85","biz":"b89","pay":2070,"brief":"Vito Esposito drives for the supplier and says a truck with about $3,450 of meat and wine goes to Bellini's Ristorante in The Bronx on Saturday night, one driver, no escort. Bellini's Ristorante pays the Santangelo family, and they will want to know who touched it. You can take it, take a little of it quietly, or sell the warning.","extra":{"gig":"shipment","value":3450},"id":"j424","created":9180,"expires":16380,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"Tommy has an inspector on him","giver":"c110","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","biz":"b111","pay":0,"brief":"A city inspector has found something wrong at Costa's Funeral Home and is hinting what it would cost to unfind it. Tommy Costa pays the family for exactly this kind of trouble. A $170 envelope to the right man would end it, or a conversation might.","extra":{"gig":"inspector","amt":170},"id":"j496","created":10620,"expires":17820,"status":"expired","notes":["It was sorted without you."]},{"kind":"gig","title":"Dom needs somebody to stand behind him","giver":"c150","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","target":"c197","pay":150,"brief":"Dom Bruno is owed $600 by Richie Russo, who has stopped coming up with excuses and started avoiding him. Dom would like a big, quiet man standing behind him when he asks one more time. It pays $150.","extra":{"gig":"muscle","owed":600},"id":"j607","created":16380,"expires":23580,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"A truck of a case of watches is due at Santoro's Jewellers","giver":"c173","via":"tip","assignee":"c85","biz":"b145","pay":990,"brief":"Frankie Greco drives for the supplier and says a truck with about $1,650 of a case of watches goes to Santoro's Jewellers in Astoria on Friday night, one driver, no escort. Santoro's Jewellers pays the Santangelo family, and they will want to know who touched it. You can take it, take a little of it quietly, or sell the warning.","extra":{"gig":"shipment","value":1650},"id":"j629","created":17820,"expires":25020,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"boost","title":"Georgie DeLuca needs cars","brief":"Georgie DeLuca at DeLuca's Auto Repair (Little Italy) is short of stock and asks no questions. He'll pay $650 a car, cash, no paperwork.","giver":"c160","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","biz":"b161","pay":650,"id":"j703","created":20700,"expires":29340,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"Ride shotgun for Fiore's Hardware’s delivery","giver":"c16","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","biz":"b87","pay":220,"brief":"Fiore's Hardware pays your family, and Sal Fiore has a truck of power tools coming in on Sunday night. Word is someone from outside has been watching the route. Hank Greco would like a man in the cab. It pays $220.","extra":{"gig":"escort"},"id":"j741","created":22140,"expires":27900,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"Artie has a bag that needs to move","giver":"c6","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","pay":70,"brief":"Artie Moretti has about $900 from the week’s book that has to get to the family by morning, and he’d rather not carry it himself. It pays $70 to deliver it. Whoever carries it could also be tempted. Artie counts it twice.","extra":{"gig":"courier","bag":900},"id":"j789","created":25020,"expires":30780,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"Ride shotgun for Palumbo's Hardware’s delivery","giver":"c14","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","biz":"b153","pay":280,"brief":"Palumbo's Hardware pays your family, and Bobby Palumbo has a truck of power tools coming in on Thursday night. Word is someone from outside has been watching the route. Gino Pellegrino would like a man in the cab. It pays $280.","extra":{"gig":"escort"},"id":"j844","created":27900,"expires":33660,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"boost","title":"Lenny Bianchi needs cars","brief":"Lenny Bianchi at Bianchi's Auto Repair (The Bronx) is short of stock and asks no questions. He'll pay $650 a car, cash, no paperwork.","giver":"c138","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","biz":"b139","pay":650,"id":"j871","created":29340,"expires":37980,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"guard","title":"Spend a week at The Gilded Lily","brief":"Mickey Amato: \"Lenny Lombardi is a friend of the family and he’s nervous. Sit in The Gilded Lily in the evenings. Be seen. Nothing else.\"","giver":"c7","via":"boss","assignee":"c85","biz":"b80","pay":0,"id":"j921","created":30780,"expires":36540,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"Sonny needs somebody to stand behind him","giver":"c116","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","target":"c176","pay":150,"brief":"Sonny Valenti is owed $300 by Bobby Moretti, who has stopped coming up with excuses and started avoiding him. Sonny would like a big, quiet man standing behind him when he asks one more time. It pays $150.","extra":{"gig":"muscle","owed":300},"id":"j954","created":32220,"expires":39420,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"Carmine has a bag that needs to move","giver":"c17","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","pay":40,"brief":"Carmine Orsini has about $500 from the week’s book that has to get to the family by morning, and he’d rather not carry it himself. It pays $40 to deliver it. Whoever carries it could also be tempted. Carmine counts it twice.","extra":{"gig":"courier","bag":500},"id":"j1000","created":35100,"expires":40860,"status":"expired"},{"kind":"gig","title":"A truck of flour and sugar is due at Galante's Bakery","giver":"c144","via":"tip","assignee":"c85","biz":"b149","pay":600,"brief":"Johnny Santoro drives for the supplier and says a truck with about $1,000 of flour and sugar goes to Galante's Bakery in Astoria on Thursday night, one driver, no escort. Galante's Bakery pays the Santangelo family, and they will want to know who touched it. You can take it, take a little of it quietly, or sell the warning.","extra":{"gig":"shipment","value":1000},"id":"j1024","created":36540,"expires":43740,"status":"offered"},{"kind":"gig","title":"Tommy needs somebody to stand behind him","giver":"c106","via":"opportunity","assignee":"c85","target":"c172","pay":150,"brief":"Tommy Caruso is owed $600 by Gino Bellini, who has stopped coming up with excuses and started avoiding him. Tommy would like a big, quiet man standing behind him when he asks one more time. It pays $150.","extra":{"gig":"muscle","owed":600},"id":"j1108","created":40860,"expires":48060,"status":"offered"}],"ventures":[],"grievances":[],"pending":[{"id":"p1113","due":46620,"kind":"dispute","a":"c40","b":"c69","c":"c38","tries":0,"note":"true"}],"enc":[{"kind":"crew","from":"c200","title":"Bobby wants a word about his future","lines":["Bobby Esposito waits until you’re alone.","\"I’ve put in my time. I want to know where I stand. I want to be made.\""],"opts":[{"code":"back","label":"Tell him you’ll put his name forward","hint":"He’ll hold you to it. If you keep it, he’s yours."},{"code":"pay","label":"Give him a bigger piece ($300 now)","hint":"Money buys time. It doesn’t buy him."},{"code":"wait","label":"Tell him it isn’t his time","hint":"He’ll take it as an answer, or as an insult."}],"data":{"what":"sit_ambition","sid":"s443","done":1},"id":"e657","t":19920,"expires":30000,"status":"lapsed"},{"kind":"crew","from":"c200","title":"Bobby has been made an offer","lines":["Bobby Esposito says he needs to be straight with you.","\"Someone from Brancato came to see me. Better money, a chair. I said I’d think about it. I’m telling you because I’d rather it came from me.\""],"opts":[{"code":"raise","label":"Lower his kick-up (−5 points)","hint":"Costs you. He stays, and he knows what you’ll do to keep a man."},{"code":"trust","label":"Tell him you trust him to decide","hint":"A big risk. Some men stay because you asked nothing."},{"code":"warn","label":"Tell him he’s yours and always will be","hint":"Fear or pride. It could go either way."}],"data":{"what":"sit_life","life":"defect","who":"c200","fam":"fam_brancato","done":1},"id":"e658","t":19920,"expires":28560,"status":"lapsed"},{"kind":"favour_ask","from":"c200","about":"c60","title":"Bobby asks about Rocco","lines":["Bobby Esposito sits down across from you without being asked.","\"Rocco DeLuca is inside. I know you know a lawyer, and a clerk who knows a judge. I won’t forget it.\""],"opts":[{"code":"do","label":"Make a call, put up $300","hint":"A man who gets out remembers who got him out."},{"code":"no","label":"It’s not your business"}],"data":{"kind":"release","jailed":"c60"},"id":"e704","t":20700,"expires":26460,"status":"lapsed"},{"kind":"kin","from":"c215","title":"Sunday dinner","lines":["Lucia Marino calls the club. Somebody fetches you.","\"I’ve made too much. I always make too much. Come, and take some home.\""],"opts":[{"code":"go","label":"Go","hint":"Four hours. Nobody will call you there."},{"code":"late","label":"Come for dessert","hint":"Better than nothing."},{"code":"no","label":"Send regrets","hint":"You’ll hear about it."}],"data":{"what":"sunday"},"id":"e705","t":20700,"expires":25020,"status":"lapsed"},{"kind":"crew","from":"c198","title":"Peter has been made an offer","lines":["Peter Bruno says he needs to be straight with you.","\"Someone from Brancato came to see me. Better money, a chair. I said I’d think about it. I’m telling you because I’d rather it came from me.\""],"opts":[{"code":"raise","label":"Lower his kick-up (−5 points)","hint":"Costs you. He stays, and he knows what you’ll do to keep a man."},{"code":"trust","label":"Tell him you trust him to decide","hint":"A big risk. Some men stay because you asked nothing."},{"code":"warn","label":"Tell him he’s yours and always will be","hint":"Fear or pride. It could go either way."}],"data":{"what":"sit_life","life":"defect","who":"c198","fam":"fam_brancato"},"id":"e1084","t":40080,"expires":48720,"status":"open"},{"kind":"kin","from":"c215","title":"Sunday dinner","lines":["Lucia Marino calls the club. Somebody fetches you.","\"It’s Sunday. There’s a roast. Your sister is coming. I won’t eat until you’re here.\""],"opts":[{"code":"go","label":"Go","hint":"Four hours. Nobody will call you there."},{"code":"late","label":"Come for dessert","hint":"Better than nothing."},{"code":"no","label":"Send regrets","hint":"You’ll hear about it."}],"data":{"what":"sunday"},"id":"e1112","t":40860,"expires":45180,"status":"open"}],"favours":[],"threats":{},"events":[],"ops":[],"goals":{"done":{"earner":1980,"friends":13500}},"ledger":[{"t":480,"wk":0,"from":"c7","to":"c152","amt":1000,"flow":"loan","note":"business loan"},{"t":9840,"wk":0,"from":"c152","to":"c7","amt":120,"flo